  "description": "A prototypical B-grade guide, Kang Yoon-oh is content with his ordinary life as an average guide. That is until one day, an S-grade esper, Kim Hyuntae comes to him for guiding. After finding Yoon-oh’s guiding abilities extraordinary and exactly what he needed, Hyuntae eventually requests that he become his very own personal guide. Now, working for Hyuntae, Yoon-oh’s life is about to go from simple to special… \n\n(Source: Lezhin US) \n\n*Note: Includes two extra chapters.*",
